  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that split works, and it's done.\n\n- **Grain bowl:** $21.60 in account credit.\n- **Lemonade:** $3.00 refunded to your Visa ending 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days. I also added $1.00 in account credit, which is the lemonade's share of the promo.\n\nYour account credit balance is now **$22.60**, and you can use it on future orders. I'm sorry again about the missing items."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, Grace, that sounds good. I appreciate you sorting out both items. I'll check that the $3.00 shows up on my Visa in the next few days and use the credit next time I order from Green Bowl."
